20623008":{"text":"今振り返ると、あの頃の私はほとんど別人のように思えるよ。","source_cn":"老实说，如今回望那时的自己，我几乎觉得那是个陌生人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96EF3BF225EA1F35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1620623009:1":{"text":"あれが、本来の……？君の言う通りかもしれないね……","source_cn":"真实的……我……？也许你说得对，本来的我并不是这样的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x234877D48EC8750A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1620623012:1":{"text":"とにかく……このように、私は残りの人生を教育に捧げた。","source_cn":"而我接下来的余生……都奉献给了教育事业。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCB5ABCBFCF0FF27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1620623013:0":{"text":"常に厳格な態度で、生徒たちにプレッシャーを与え続けたんだ。","source_cn":"可我的严苛，却给学生们带来了不可逆的压力……这是我最大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBB663EFBF43B4E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1620623014:1":{"text":"できることなら、あの頃に戻って謝りたい……","source_cn":"这是我最大的遗憾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17FFD2ED3E792B6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1620623014":{"text":"できることなら、あの頃に戻って謝りたい……","source_cn":"这是我最大的遗憾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17FFD2ED3E792B6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1620623015:1":{"text":"温かい言葉をありがとう。","source_cn":"你的话让人感到温暖……谢谢你。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB587340DD1B81072","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"温かい言葉をありがとう。","female":"温かい言葉をありがとう。","variant_male_record_index":"215389","variant_female_record_index":"215390","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1620623016:1":{"text":"でも……私の生徒たちはそうは思わないだろうね。","source_cn":"但我的学生们，又会怎么想呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31DD7058AAC4026D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1620623018:0":{"text":"自分が取り返しのつかない過ちを犯していることに……最も優秀な生徒が倒れるまで気付かないのだから……","source_cn":"我曾经最好的学生，因为压力而昏厥，那一刻我才意识到自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F4AF5E113D7B3EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1620623019:0":{"text":"思うんですけど……その生徒は本当にプレッシャーが原因で倒れたのでしょうか？","source_cn":"我倒觉得……那位昏厥的学生，不一定是因为压力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F0C52935295A90C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1620623020:1":{"text":"たとえば僕も……本当に学問が大好きで、よく寝食を忘れて研究に没頭してしまうんです。","source_cn":"有些人天生就热爱学术……比如我，我经常废寝忘食地研究魔法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh6